# corpus-data: research corpora are re-fetchable (pinned records in ACQUISITION-LOG)
# and carry CC-BY-NC / research-only licences — the DATA never enters git in a
# maybe-public repo. The docs (acquisition log, licence notes, provenance, dataset
# cards, mirror READMEs) DO commit. Data dirs are backed up outside git.
# [2026-07-16 restructure S5]
corpus-data/**
!corpus-data/**/
!corpus-data/**/*.md
!corpus-data/ACQUISITION-LOG.md

